DESCRIPTION:https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l2kfiNoRi6ofM5pSjr1rCloOfpx.jpg
 \n(名探偵コナン ハイウェイの堕天使 — Meitantei Conan: Hig
 hway no Datenshi)   (17.7)\n1h49\n\nAnimation\, Action\, Mystère\, Crime\
 nJapan\n\nRéalisateur : 蓮井隆弘\nScénario : 大倉崇裕\nPhotograp
 hie : 西山仁\nProduction : TMS Entertainment\, TOHO\, Nippon Television
  Network Corporation\n\nActeurs :\n- Minami Takayama\n- Wakana Yamazaki\n-
  Rikiya Koyama\n- Megumi Hayashibara\n- Miyuki Sawashiro\n- Shin-ichiro Mi
 ki\n- 神奈延年\n- 横浜流星\n- 畑芽育\n- Akio Ōtsuka\n- Noriko 
 Hidaka\n- 杉本ゆう\n\n\n(synopsis non encore traduit sur TMDB)\nWhen a
  string of deadly highway incidents begin\, Conan Edogawa's investigations
  point towards an orchestrated plot rather than mere accidents. As he unco
 vers a conspiracy involving hidden identities and advanced technology\, th
 e case escalates into a high-speed race against time to stop a calculating
